## Clever Cloud apps

| Environment | App name | App ID | SSH zone | URL |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| test | {{APP_TEST_NAME}} | {{APP_TEST_ID}} | {{ZONE}} (CC Console → App → Information) | {{APP_TEST_URL}} |
| prod | {{APP_PROD_NAME}} | {{APP_PROD_ID}} | {{ZONE}} | {{APP_PROD_URL}} |

> SSH zone: read the exact hostname from CC Console → App → Information tab → Git deployment URL.
> It is NOT a marketing region name ("EU West", "NA") — it's a zone identifier like `par`, `mtl`, etc.

---

## Branch convention

| Branch | Environment | Deploy |
|---|---|---|
| `main` | Production | Auto-deploy via CC native GitHub integration |
| `test` | Staging | GitHub Actions → SSH push on every push to `test` |
| `feat/*` | — | CI only (lint, typecheck, build — no deploy) |

---

## Deploy

```
/cc-deploy --app test
/cc-deploy --app prod
```

---

## Migrations

- **ORM**: {{ORM_NAME}} (drizzle | prisma | alembic | other)
- **Migrations path**: {{MIGRATIONS_PATH}} (e.g. `src/db/migrations`)
- **Run command**: {{MIGRATE_COMMAND}} (e.g. `npm run db:migrate`)
- **CC hook**: `CC_PRE_RUN_HOOK={{MIGRATE_COMMAND}}` — set in CC Console env vars
  - Use `CC_PRE_RUN_HOOK`, NOT `CC_PRE_BUILD_HOOK` (pre-build fires before npm install)

---

## Health check

- **Endpoint**: {{HEALTH_ENDPOINT}} (e.g. `/health`)
- **CC env var**: `CC_HEALTH_CHECK_PATH={{HEALTH_ENDPOINT}}` — set on both test and prod apps
- Response format: `{ "status": "ok", "version": "x.y.z" }`

---

## Key env vars

| Variable | test | prod | Notes |
|---|---|---|---|
| `DATABASE_URL` | set in CC | set in CC | Runtime — `clever restart` to apply |
| `CC_PRE_RUN_HOOK` | `{{MIGRATE_COMMAND}}` | `{{MIGRATE_COMMAND}}` | Build-affecting — full redeploy required |
| `CC_HEALTH_CHECK_PATH` | `{{HEALTH_ENDPOINT}}` | `{{HEALTH_ENDPOINT}}` | |
| `NODE_ENV` | `staging` | `production` | |

**Runtime vars** (`clever restart` is enough): `DATABASE_URL`, `REDIS_URL`, `API_KEY`, secrets.
**Build-affecting vars** (require full redeploy + rebuild): `CC_NODE_VERSION`, `CC_PRE_RUN_HOOK`, `CC_PRE_BUILD_HOOK`.

