## CC CLI quick reference

```bash
clever deploy -f                      # deploy current branch
clever status                         # current app state
clever logs --since 30m | tail -80    # recent logs (snapshot)
clever restart                        # restart (reuses build)
clever restart --commit <sha>         # rollback to a specific commit
clever activity                       # deployment history
clever env set KEY=VALUE              # set one env var
```

